---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
---

<Layout title="Home" local="Welcome!">
	<div class="flex flex-row justify-around items-center bg-bg text-text">
		<div class="inline-flex p-0 m-0 w-7/10 max-w-[600px]">
			<!-- Little exerpt about me -->
			<p class="bg-bg text-text">
				Hey there! My name is Jatinder, and this is my personal webpage.
				I am currently pursuing a Joint Honours degree in Computer
				Science and Mathematics at the University of Manitoba, with a
				minor in Statistics. More specifically, my interests lie in
				discrete algorithms and computational geometry, as well as
				Number theory and Topology. I also enjoy programming,
				specifically low-level systems programming, and developed more
				interest in programming embedded and operating systems.<br />
				<br />
				On this website, you will find information about myself, including
				more about my own personal life and interests, projects and experiences,
				as well as a deeper dive into my hobbies, interests, and motivation.
				I encourage you stick around and read, and check back in every once
				in a while to see how the site has changed. I will most likely add
				a page for updates recently made to the website, or I may merge it
				with the already existing Updates page. We will see! I will upload
				my resume when it is updated.<br />
				<br />
				Thanks for reading,<br />
				Jatinder<br />
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="inline-flex p-0 m-0 w-3/10 h-auto max-w-[400px]">
			<Hero size="400" />
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
